   "description": "Traces that could not be read back from Tempo. A `too_large` fetch means the trace exceeded Tempo's read-path gRPC message limit (server.grpc_server_max_send_msg_size) and was dropped WHOLE \u2014 its job silently disappears from the run store and the run/job roll-ups (this is how tests_torch vanished from the Jobs table). `tempo: trace-by-id 5xx` is the same failure seen from Tempo's side.",
