   "title": "PVC on-disk usage vs limit",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "description": "On-disk usage of the Tempo and Prometheus PVCs vs their provisioned limits, to follow the 90d-retention fill. Tempo = sum(tempodb_backend_bytes_total) (350 GiB PVC, 90d block_retention). Prometheus = TSDB block bytes (100 GiB PVC, 90d retention; excludes the small WAL/head). kubelet_volume_stats_* is not scraped here, so these are app-level on-disk sizes, not filesystem df. The run-store PVC (30 GiB) has no size metric yet."
